{"id":"66345f26-1eb8-4f9c-aa75-58f9b01d9d18","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:24:48.993Z","batchId":"onboarding_claude-opus-5-5_low","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-opus-5-5","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1 class=\"h1\">Welcome to Fieldnote</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Set up your workspace in three quick steps. You can change any of this later in Settings.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"between row\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\" id=\"stepText\">Step 1 of 3 · Account</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\" id=\"stepBadge\">33% complete</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"bar\" style=\"width:33%\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\" id=\"steps\">\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" data-s=\"0\"><span class=\"avatar\">1</span><div><div class=\"h4\">Account</div><div class=\"small muted\">Name and login</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" data-s=\"1\"><span class=\"avatar\">2</span><div><div class=\"h4\">Preferences</div><div class=\"small muted\">Workspace setup</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" data-s=\"2\"><span class=\"avatar\">3</span><div><div class=\"h4\">Done</div><div class=\"small muted\">Review and start</div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack\" id=\"panel0\">\n    <div><div class=\"card-title\">Create your account</div><div class=\"card-desc\">We’ll use these details to sign you in and label your work.</div></div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n      <label>Full name<input id=\"name\" placeholder=\"Priya Raman\" autocomplete=\"name\"></label>\n      <label>Work email<input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"priya@northwind.io\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label>\n    </div>\n    <label>Password<input id=\"pw\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\" autocomplete=\"new-password\"></label>\n    <p class=\"small muted\">Use 8+ characters with a mix of letters and numbers.</p>\n    <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\" id=\"err\" hidden>Please enter your name, a valid email, and a password of at least 8 characters.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack\" id=\"panel1\" hidden>\n    <div><div class=\"card-title\">Tailor your workspace</div><div class=\"card-desc\">These defaults shape your dashboard and notifications.</div></div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n      <label>Workspace name<input id=\"ws\" placeholder=\"Northwind Research\"></label>\n      <label>Team size\n        <select id=\"team\"><option>Just me</option><option selected>2–10</option><option>11–50</option><option>51+</option></select>\n      </label>\n      <label>Primary use\n        <select id=\"use\"><option>Product research</option><option>Customer interviews</option><option>Field studies</option></select>\n      </label>\n      <label>Time zone\n        <select id=\"tz\"><option>UTC−08:00 Pacific</option><option>UTC−05:00 Eastern</option><option selected>UTC+00:00 London</option><option>UTC+05:30 India</option></select>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"h4\">Notifications</span>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"n1\" checked> Weekly summary email</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"n2\" checked> Mentions and comments</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"n3\"> Product updates and tips</label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack\" id=\"panel2\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge\">Ready</span><div class=\"card-title\">You’re all set</div></div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Review your setup below. Use Back to change anything before you finish.</p>\n    <table class=\"table\">\n      <tbody id=\"summary\"></tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"between row\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" id=\"back\" disabled>← Back</button>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\" id=\"hint\">Next: Preferences</span>\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"next\">Next →</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var s=0,names=[\"Account\",\"Preferences\",\"Done\"],pct=[33,67,100];\n  var $=function(i){return document.getElementById(i)};\n  function render(){\n    for(var i=0;i<3;i++){$(\"panel\"+i).hidden=i!==s;\n      var el=document.querySelector('[data-s=\"'+i+'\"]');el.style.opacity=i<=s?1:.5;\n      el.querySelector(\".avatar\").textContent=i<s?\"✓\":i+1;}\n    $(\"stepText\").textContent=\"Step \"+(s+1)+\" of 3 · \"+names[s];\n    $(\"stepBadge\").textContent=pct[s]+\"% complete\";\n    $(\"bar\").style.width=pct[s]+\"%\";\n    $(\"back\").disabled=s===0;\n    $(\"next\").textContent=s===2?\"Go to dashboard\":\"Next →\";\n    $(\"hint\").textContent=s<2?\"Next: \"+names[s+1]:\"Takes you to your new workspace\";\n    if(s===2){\n      var n=[$(\"n1\"),$(\"n2\"),$(\"n3\")].filter(function(c){return c.checked}).map(function(c){return c.parentNode.textContent.trim()});\n      var rows=[[\"Name\",$(\"name\").value],[\"Email\",$(\"email\").value],[\"Workspace\",$(\"ws\").value||\"Untitled workspace\"],[\"Team size\",$(\"team\").value],[\"Primary use\",$(\"use\").value],[\"Time zone\",$(\"tz\").value],[\"Notifications\",n.length?n.join(\", \"):\"None\"]];\n    